      "threshold": ">50 quarantines in 30m for 5m; initial agent threshold, not calibrated from production.",
      "evaluated_bad": "Synthetic: 51 quarantine decisions in 30m.",
      "evaluated_good": "Synthetic: 50 quarantine decisions in 30m, or would_quarantine only."
    },
